    "detailed_description": "Use your logic to paint beautiful images in this relaxing and cute puzzle. The gorgeous visuals and relaxing soundtrack will help you forget all your problems and have a great time! The pictures feature a delicious array of desserts from all around the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relaxing puzzles<br></li><li>No timers, no pressure<br></li><li>58 Levels<br></li><li>Unique solution for each puzzle<br></li><li>Increasing level dimensions, up to 25x25<br></li><li>Level progress is saved when you leave a level<br></li><li>Click the middle mouse button to measure the grid</li></ul>",
